flowchart TB
  orch["编排层 src/orchestration + src/agents<br/>StateGraph 装配·Supervisor·各 Worker 节点"]:::engine
  mem["记忆层 src/memory<br/>读写 API·显式 scope·任务完成节流·后端失败隔离"]:::memory
  sto["存储层 src/storage<br/>Checkpointer·确定性图谱·语义向量·ConversationLog"]:::storage
  obs["横切 src/observability<br/>统一日志(入口接线·业务层不依赖)"]:::log

  orch -->|"只能向下调用"| mem
  mem -->|"只能向下调用"| sto
  obs -.-> orch & mem & sto

